Shoals.Curves.bootstrap_multi: invalid instrument (see instrument_validate)

The exact input the deleted positive test used, with the opposite expectation.
It fails on the *second* instrument's negative tenor. The diagnostic is
byte-identical whichever instrument is invalid, so this test does not pin
*which* one failed, and it is not evidence that the guard runs per pillar
rather than as an up-front sweep -- that follows from the deletion of
`cur_all_instruments_valid`, which is visible in the diff and in no test.
